# Day 2 — Secondary Plate and Wiring Clearance

The second stage focused on creating the mounting area for the secondary plate and providing enough space for its wiring.

### Work Completed

- Measured the secondary plate
- Created a **71 mm × 55 mm** rectangular recessed slot
- Used **Cut-Extrude** to make the slot **15 mm deep**
- Added a **10 mm × 18 mm** clearance pocket beside the plate
- Extended the clearance pocket **21 mm deep**
- Designed this pocket to provide additional room for the side of the plate and its electrical connection
- Added a **14 mm × 10 mm** wiring passage
- Extended the wiring passage through the enclosure so the wire could exit the casing
- Used dimensioned sketches to control the location and size of each feature

### SolidWorks Tools Used

- Sketch
- Smart Dimension
- Rectangle
- Cut-Extrude

