# Final Product

The completed design combines the casing, component cavities, wire routing features, rotating PCB retention system, and mechanical stops into a single mechanical enclosure concept.

The PCB can be inserted through the rear opening and retained using the rotating top and bottom rails.

The rails can then be rotated away when access to the PCB is required.

